          "edge_id": "edge_007",
          "edge_type": "REFERENCES",
          "source": "e002",
          "target": "e008",
          "evidence_unit_ids": [
            "v7u_N002743"
          ],
          "source_quote": "At this point in the risk assessment process, it is important to understand national and sectoral risk assessments that apply to the industry sector and jurisdictions in which the organizations operate."
        },
        {
          "edge_id": "edge_008",
          "edge_type": "REFERENCES",
          "source": "e002",
          "target": "e009",
          "evidence_unit_ids": [
            "v7u_N002740"
          ],
          "relation_type": "standard_constrains_action",
          "source_quote": "While the process may begin with a qualitative understanding of the risk, it is important to back it up with quantitative data to establish relevance."
        }
      ],
